{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "d7b1271df27986ddd7d20a01707fb96e48247d7540213b64cae3c0b012d5adcc", "ja": "ドキドキ☆試食タイム", "zh": "心跳加速☆试吃时间", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6545f4dc68ae59e7d960a31432dafe66a381d26f66946fba09c8e6e4c0209171", "ja": "未来のチョコを試食したプロデューサーは、\n一瞬意識を失う。目覚めた後、何故か気分は\nスッキリしていた。その後、他のチョコも\n試食することに……頑張れプロデューサー！\nお客さん達の健康を守るために！", "zh": "试吃了未来的巧克力后，制作人一瞬间失去了意识。醒来后，不知为何感觉神清气爽。之后，还要继续试吃其他巧克力……加油，制作人！为了守护客人们的健康！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6f1cc8289edfac5fb2ac86cd1983246c8c393106cef0235ee30e376b7dd2ead5", "ja": "（アイドル達の長い戦いが、終わった……。\nきっと皆、全力を尽くすことができたはずだ）", "zh": "（偶像们漫长的战斗结束了……\n想必大家都已经竭尽全力了吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "518149c875903f9afa19818dc508cff44c6788022fc41f42b4f0bda72b858bd5", "ja": "はーっ。\nチョコ作り、大変だったけど楽しかった～♪", "zh": "呼——\n做巧克力虽然很辛苦，但很开心～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "d717e075dcdf5b897e7dd265f289ffa77bc0d0f1a8a2fb3c2f0c0e02d17fa0e2", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！　これ、\n私が作ったチョコクッキーです。食べてください！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！这个是我做的巧克力曲奇。请吃吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b3e69fc0dc72eac9881bde866f8d1519f3af1a4638d1c540cab095b2cdb28b7a", "ja": "俺の分も作ってくれたのか？\n未来のは味見しないとと思ってたし、いただくよ。", "zh": "也给我做了一份吗？\n我正想着得尝尝未来做的，那我就不客气了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c4977e6e73651cc6a87fd345c9aa60ea15ba296c55a02c97b5070b4701f9a0e2", "ja": "もぐもぐ……ウッ！！！！", "zh": "嚼嚼……唔！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "b1e98b35bdf555e35909febefc4aaeab5da8976b0d3b8c6c5595bbd7961a04f4", "ja": "{$P$}さん？　……た、大変！\n{$P$}さんが、気絶しちゃった！！", "zh": "{$P$}先生？　……不、不得了了！\n{$P$}先生昏过去了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "7b9b8760b8ed5e2ce35512ae9996354390fa003e05d7873b89c3fa9c8aac16fc", "ja": "そんな……{$P$}ちゃん！　お願い、\n目を開けて！　{$P$}ちゃん……！", "zh": "怎么会这样……{$P$}！拜托了，睁开眼睛！{$P$}……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "9c9ce45a38b5f75c72fa904fabc6f9195f81cdd7ed580bda6d114fc6ff8d473a", "ja": "こんなところで……{$P$}には、\nやらなきゃいけないことがまだあるじゃないですか！", "zh": "怎么能在这种地方……{$P$}不是还有必须完成的事情吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "7d080dac72ed41fe7845ea8e147b9963759869479ff3e483b74e1bc267e73762", "ja": "ダメだよ、{$P$}さん！\nこのまま目を覚まさないなんて、杏奈……！", "zh": "不行啊，{$P$}先生！\n就这样一直醒不过来，杏奈……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "28d2801bcc8eca8df0831b9d89e1231b41220e6cc14233b56d838ebd7205e9fe", "ja": "…………ハッ！\nどうかしたのか？　みんな……。", "zh": "…………哈！\n怎么了吗？大家……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "081f4a7f7e27ec6f38813d5035777a69dac5d8eb2792ab5957e8ac717225419e", "ja": "良かったぁ～！　もう、心配させないでよね、\n{$P$}！", "zh": "太好了～！真是的，别让人担心好不好，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "138a60309a0f5ef9d7d68011930dc35de3d2e3181592b52df6bde03578fe085f", "ja": "{$P$}、未来ちゃんのチョコを\n食べてから少しの間、気を失っていたんですよ。", "zh": "{$P$}，吃下未来的巧克力后，有一小段时间失去意识了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "56db78952256b13b268f4627c10c93d9c7eaa4aa89a5f5e45873902eb2208cf6", "ja": "気を失って……？　そうだったのか。", "zh": "失去意识……？原来是这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "de3fe484ae63a48ffc88827ea4a8b42222400fd042244efc347af51626c48caa", "ja": "うう、ごめんなさい……{$P$}さん、\n大丈夫ですか？　気持ち悪くないですか？", "zh": "呜，对不起……{$P$}先生，\n你没事吧？有没有觉得不舒服？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e3cd171e21a2f81f8dce28300b1a99a5938d1b7ff8660bfb2d27585f5a33c950", "ja": "いや……その逆で、不思議と気分がいいというか。\n頭がスッキリしてるし、体も軽いような……。", "zh": "不……正好相反，不可思议的是感觉还挺舒服的。\n头脑很清醒，身体好像也变轻了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "4c011872258b7645143326a51abd59c96338dd836222772b5eca56f062cf1fca", "ja": "ホントですか！？　それって、私がチョコクッキーに\n入れた、プロテインとにんにくのおかげかも？", "zh": "真的吗！？这该不会是因为我加进巧克力曲奇里的蛋白粉和大蒜吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "76ad98cfbfee89ebb951326cd57e787e84c44b8f17a42ed9150a580f7a1b4751", "ja": "そういえば、{$P$}、\nさっきより腕に筋肉がついたような……。", "zh": "对了，{$P$}，感觉你的手臂好像比刚才更有肌肉了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "8aa0cb84d5e86725b4238398829831d6cc32b36e1c0805095cc48e76435baabe", "ja": "いや、いくらなんでも効き目早すぎでしょ！", "zh": "不对，再怎么说这见效也太快了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "80e0f6728bfa085004888bee0f1e70d60ab68d0bd7d2313b513be21757776e47", "ja": "未来のチョコ、やっぱり危険だったね。\n……杏奈のチョコも、毒味してくれる？", "zh": "未来的巧克力果然很危险呢。\n……也帮杏奈试吃一下巧克力，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "00e44d2f5c743141c44beb431f0de0be279f6397f02892f0c35a433c1c01a672", "ja": "あ、ついでにアタシのチョコも食べてみてよ。\n危険はないと思うけど、おいしくできたか知りたいし！", "zh": "啊，顺便也尝尝我的巧克力吧。\n应该没有危险，不过我想知道做得好不好吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "3bf358ab49e11295091cc190d1b9f07c13aeba14e25dd64c5018ab47661f65a2", "ja": "茜ちゃんの背中、茜ちゃんの右手、\n茜ちゃんのキュートなのの字のおめめ……。", "zh": "小茜的背面、小茜的右手，还有小茜那双画成可爱“の”字形的眼睛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "6c1546bf19bac57e29b946d907232f41e529f92317fe0495b568f75484dc03f2", "ja": "どこでも好きな場所を選んでいいよ、\n{$P$}ちゃん♪", "zh": "可以随便选你喜欢的地方哦，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1022_p", "source_sha256": "fabb55723990729b7aa81711958a8e12c933687a94316525f8e7845f9590009c", "ja": "（目の前に積まれたチョコレートの山……\n最後にこれを、ファンの皆さんに配るんだったな）", "zh": "（眼前堆着一座巧克力山……最后要把这些分发给各位粉丝来着。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_06_1023_p", "source_sha256": "0ed00a0ca03c8db0f364b14bfdcd246524eb50c9f4731ebb1da47ed3cf5119f5", "ja": "（ファンの皆さんの安全と健康のため、速やかに\n試食しなくては。たとえ、命に代えても……！）", "zh": "（为了所有粉丝的安全和健康，必须赶紧试吃才行。哪怕要以生命为代价……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
